      <title>ROUNDUP: East Union has electric start to D-III girls hoops playoffs</title>
      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/roundup-east-union-has-electric-start-to-d-iii-girls-hoops-playoffs/</link>
      <description>Electrical issues forced a delay in action and change in venues for East Union’s Sac-Joaquin Section Division III girls basketball playoff opener on Tuesday. The game was moved across town to Manteca High after the first quarter, and the second-seeded Lancers rallied past No. 15 Yuba City, 58-29.</description>
